<h1 data-copy-en="Cotton" data-copy-zh="Cotton">Cotton</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Studio visits, band recognition, three heart-to-hearts and optional dates." data-copy-zh="音乐工作室、乐队认可、三次谈心与可选约会。">Studio visits, band recognition, three heart-to-hearts and optional dates.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Cotton</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_Evening_Branches_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_Evening:_Unlock_and_Repeatability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Band_and_Nyx_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Separate_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="On_Her_Terms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Phone_Down"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unfinished_Chorus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_H2Hs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Cotton — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cotton.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cotton — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cotton.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cotton — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Cotton’s route moves between the Music Studio and her room. Her ordinary social actions are in the room; the studio hosts the first personal heart-to-heart and automatic music-related visits.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Cotton</h2><p>Travel to Present → Downtown → Music Studio. To Cotton’s Room is a zero-time door from the studio. Her morning studio appearance does not give the same action list as her afternoon room visit.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Music Studio</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cotton's Room</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starting_Her_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Build band Clout to 16 and visit the studio for Star Treatment; its relationship reward helps open Talk at Acknowledged(10). In her room, Stage Lights needs Known(25), while Fan Service needs Friend(100). Complete both, then return to the studio 09:00–14:00 for The Unfinished Take.</p><p>Continue with the three heart-to-hearts below. Between them, visit the room for Off the Feed at Close Friend(200),14:00–19:00, and A Private Invitation at Crush(400),18:00–20:00. Each needs the preceding personal conversation. The Fair Date and Stargazing are optional additions; they do not replace these visits.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Unfinished Chorus</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Music Studio; 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Unfinished Take</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Star Treatment</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Star Treatment</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Phone Down</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Off the Feed / Unfinished Chorus</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">On Her Terms</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after A Private Invitation / Phone Down</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Conversation.2C_Gifts_and_Instruction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Conversation,_Gifts_and_Instruction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Stage Presence is a one-time skill lesson, not a stat-training repeat. Bring Charm 18, Friend(100),$400,70 Energy and 60 Calm, and budget 200 minutes. The ordinary gift actions consume the actual Teddy, Perfume or Jewelry item.</p><p>The paid Fair Date needs Star Treatment; the separate Voucher fair action uses one Voucher. Both still need Cotton to be available in her room, so the usable Voucher start window begins at 14:00 even though its wider action window starts earlier.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Cotton</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Teddy Bear</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Teddy ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Perfume</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Perfume ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Jewelry ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Stage Presence</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Charm 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">200 min; $400; −70 Energy; −60 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Stage Presence; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Evening</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cotton's Room; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after On Her Terms</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>If Cotton has a portrait but no ordinary Talk action in the morning, visit her room after 14:00. If the first personal visit is missing, check band Clout rather than only relationship points.</p><p>For a later heart-to-heart, check both the prior room event and completed conversation. Raising affection beyond the threshold does not complete those steps. Gift and Talk allowances are per action type and reset with the game day.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships</a> · <a href="skills.html">Skills</a> · <a href="character-nyx.html">Nyx</a> · <a href="character-talena.html">Talena</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_Evening_Branches_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_Evening:_Unlock_and_Repeatability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Band_and_Nyx_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Separate_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-On_Her_Terms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Phone_Down"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unfinished_Chorus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_H2Hs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Cotton 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cotton.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cotton 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cotton.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cotton 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Cotton的路线在音乐工作室与她的房间之间推进。普通社交动作主要在房间内，工作室则用于首段个人谈心和与音乐有关的自动事件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>路线为现代 → 市中心 → 音乐工作室，再使用「前往Cotton的房间」，这道门不耗时。她早上在工作室出现，并不代表会提供下午房间里的同一套动作。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">音乐工作室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cotton的房间</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_Her_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>乐队声望达到16后，到工作室触发「明星待遇」，其关系奖励能帮助开放已遇见（10）阶段的交谈。房间里的「舞台灯光」要求已知（25），「粉丝福利」要求朋友（100）；两项完成后，于09:00—14:00回工作室推进「未完成的录音」。</p><p>之后依次完成下表三次谈心。其间还要回房间推进亲密朋友（200）的「动态之外」，时段14:00—19:00，以及迷恋（400）的「私下的邀请」，时段18:00—20:00；两项都检查前一段个人对话。游乐场约会和观星是可选补充，不能代替这些步骤。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">未完成的副歌</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">音乐工作室; 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：未完成的录音</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：明星待遇</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富150；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观星</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：明星待遇</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">放下手机</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：动态之外、未完成的副歌</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">由她决定</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：私下的邀请、放下手机</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Conversation.2C_Gifts_and_Instruction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Conversation,_Gifts_and_Instruction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>舞台魅力是一次性技能课程，不是可反复刷属性的训练。准备魅力18、朋友（100）、财富400、精力70、镇定60，并留出200分钟。普通赠礼会实际消耗泰迪熊、香水或珠宝。</p><p>付费游乐场约会要求先完成「明星待遇」；另一项凭兑换券的游乐场活动则消耗1张兑换券。两者仍须在Cotton待在房间时开始，所以兑换券活动实际从14:00起可用，不是动作较宽时段所写的更早时间。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Cotton 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送泰迪熊</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；泰迪熊 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送香水</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；香水 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；珠宝 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习舞台魅力</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 14:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；魅力18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">200分钟；财富400；−70 精力；−60 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会舞台魅力；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密夜晚</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Cotton的房间; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：由她决定</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；−50 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>早上能看见Cotton，却没有普通交谈时，14:00后去她的房间。首个个人事件没出现时，除了关系点，也要检查乐队声望。</p><p>后续谈心同时检查前一项房间事件与已完成谈心；单纯把关系刷过门槛不会自动完成。交谈与不同赠礼各有自己的每日额度，随游戏日刷新。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密</a> · <a href="skills.html">技能</a> · <a href="character-nyx.html">Nyx</a> · <a href="character-talena.html">Talena</a></p></section>
